---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' https://forum.plantuml.net/20492
' Removing a state that sits in the middle of the chain must drop BOTH its
' incoming and outgoing node-style labels, not just one side.
skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node

state Idle
state Charging $charging
state Faulted

Idle --> Charging : start
Charging --> Faulted : fault

remove $charging
@enduml
